  "title": "Nordic Regional NWP Models",
  "description": "Hourly 2 km atmospheric analysis and forecast archive derived from the Danish HARMONIE regional NWP model (covering Greenland and Iceland) and the 2.5 km MEPS model (covering the Nordic regions). The dataset archives the first three forecast steps of each model run to produce an effective hourly analysis product. All data are stored in Icechunk format, spanning from late 2023 to the present.",
